{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":234264,\"title\":\"The Return of Boston Blackie\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Just out of jail and vowing to go straight, former jewel thief Boston Blackie, undertakes the reformation of a pretty blonde who has stolen a necklace from a cabaret dancer. He learns that the jewel belongs to the mother of the blonde girl, and the blonde's philandering father gave it as a gift to the cabaret girl. Now, Blackie must find a way to return the necklace to the owner's safe without arousing the suspicions of the girl's family.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/58cfZLAN1e69UKwkxaqfG8V7C3G.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Ntdw3cx7cMAeU6l4bZoHzjXZRn.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":1927,\"runtime\":77,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Harry O. Hoyt\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":29250,\"name\":\"Harry O. Hoyt\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1187492,\"name\":\"Strongheart\",\"character\":\"Strongheart the Dog\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5G3GyNGjoxVtlCDumYMLMAZMuW.jpg\"},{\"id\":88714,\"name\":\"Bob Custer\",\"character\":\"Boston Blackie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7eJDFfFBYki6nDErCtekBPYHNgL.jpg\"},{\"id\":985035,\"name\":\"Corliss Palmer\",\"character\":\"Sylvia Markham\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pH5xGefuwjPEUpBJSriLgTb4gTY.jpg\"},{\"id\":1269823,\"name\":\"Rosemary Cooper\",\"character\":\"Necklace Nellie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y7l6sWRPPd36BFAyum7RZCv7ZMK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1269825,\"name\":\"Coit Albertson\",\"character\":\"Denver Dan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uiMVJJbxuif0MwFnRmNXA3XMVgs.jpg\"},{\"id\":981096,\"name\":\"William Worthington\",\"character\":\"John Markham\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9c