://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Kn6qW3an3DkPl3MahWemTzrjCt.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A sadistic serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":476943,\"title\":\"Crooked Alley\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tTr2Dz4r11vU84PhAtYahsFAoCO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"year\":1923,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Reformed criminal Boston Blackie is outraged when a judge refuses to grant a pardon for a dying friend. He hires Norine, his now-dead friend's daughter, to get to the judge through his son Rudy. However, things don't work out quite as Blackie had planned.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"h37OIdbKF-E\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ppvBezAsWio\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"_Drf2YkiW7s\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}